    "Claude 的設定開著": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude’s settings are open"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude 的設定開著"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是這裡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not here"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不是這裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便利貼": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "便利貼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便利貼列表": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes List"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "便利貼列表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便利貼檔案可能來自較新版本的 Hintlet，或已損壞。原檔沒有刪除，已保留在：\n\n%@\n\n「Backups」資料夾裡也有較早的備份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The notes file may come from a newer version of Hintlet, or it may be damaged. It wasn’t deleted; it’s kept at:\n\n%@\n\nThe “Backups” folder also has earlier copies."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "便利貼檔案可能來自較新版本的 Hintlet，或已損壞。原檔沒有刪除，已保留在：\n\n%@\n\n「Backups」資料夾裡也有較早的備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便利貼檔案可能來自較新版本的 Hintlet，或已損壞，而且無法移開。為了不覆蓋它，這次執行期間不會儲存任何便利貼。\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The notes file may come from a newer version of Hintlet, or it may be damaged, and it couldn’t be moved aside. So it isn’t overwritten, no notes will be saved until Hintlet restarts.\n\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "便利貼檔案可能來自較新版本的 Hintlet，或已損壞，而且無法移開。為了不覆蓋它，這次執行期間不會儲存任何便利貼。\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "備份": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "備份與搬家": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back Up or Move to Another Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份與搬家"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全域快捷鍵": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global Shortcuts"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全域快捷鍵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全域快捷鍵需要包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A global shortcut needs ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全域快捷鍵需要包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全選": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
