    "在任何 App 裡都能使用。按一下快捷鍵再按下新的組合，按 Esc 取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These work in any app. Click a shortcut, then press the new combination, or Esc to cancel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何 App 裡都能使用。按一下快捷鍵再按下新的組合，按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
