    "打開網頁後，就能把便利貼貼在那個網頁上。也可以先貼在整個視窗。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open a web page, then you can stick a note on it. Or stick it on the whole window for now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打開網頁後，就能把便利貼貼在那個網頁上。也可以先貼在整個視窗。"
