    "無法讀取先前的便利貼": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your earlier notes couldn’t be read"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取先前的便利貼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用來知道你目前在哪個視窗，讓便利貼在切走時隱藏、回來時出現，並跟著視窗移動。Hintlet 只讀取視窗的位置與標題，不會記錄你的輸入。沒有這個權限時，便利貼只能浮動顯示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets Hintlet know which window you’re in, so notes hide when you switch away, come back when you return, and move with their window. Hintlet reads only windows’ positions and titles and never records your typing. Without it, notes can only float."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用來知道你目前在哪個視窗，讓便利貼在切走時隱藏、回來時出現，並跟著視窗移動。Hintlet 只讀取視窗的位置與標題，不會記錄你的輸入。沒有這個權限時，便利貼只能浮動顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
