    "Hintlet 設定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet 設定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hintlet 需要「%@」權限，才能知道你目前在哪個視窗，讓便利貼在切走時隱藏、回來時出現，並跟著視窗移動。\n\n請在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › %@」中打開「Hintlet」。\n\nHintlet 只讀取視窗的位置與標題，不會記錄你的輸入，也不會上傳任何內容。\n\n沒有授權時，便利貼仍可使用，但會一直浮動顯示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet needs the “%1$@” permission to know which window you’re in, so notes hide when you switch away, come back when you return, and move with the window.\n\nTurn on Hintlet in System Settings › Privacy & Security › %2$@.\n\nHintlet reads only each window’s position and title. It doesn’t record what you type or upload anything.\n\nWithout it, notes still work, but they always float."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet 需要「%@」權限，才能知道你目前在哪個視窗，讓便利貼在切走時隱藏、回來時出現，並跟著視窗移動。\n\n請在「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › %@」中打開「Hintlet」。\n\nHintlet 只讀取視窗的位置與標題，不會記錄你的輸入，也不會上傳任何內容。\n\n沒有授權時，便利貼仍可使用，但會一直浮動顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hintlet（已隱藏全部）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet (all hidden)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet（已隱藏全部）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
