    "裝置控制與資料存取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Device Control & Data Access"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置控制與資料存取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要把便利貼貼在某個 Claude 對話上，Hintlet 需要請 Claude 開啟完整的輔助使用資訊，才能知道目前顯示的是哪個對話。\n\n開啟後 Claude 會多用一些記憶體與處理器資源。Hintlet 只讀取對話的網址與標題；只有你開了 AI 便利貼的 Chat 對話，才會讀取頁面上已載入的訊息來寫摘要。\n\n不開啟的話，在 Claude 上的便利貼會綁在整個視窗。之後可以在「設定 › 權限」改變。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To stick notes on a Claude conversation, Hintlet asks Claude to turn on its full accessibility information, so it can tell which conversation is showing.\n\nClaude then uses a little more memory and processor time. Hintlet reads only the conversation’s address and title; only in a Chat conversation where you turned on an AI note does it read the messages the page has loaded, to write the summary.\n\nIf you don’t turn it on, notes on Claude stick to the whole window. You can change this later in Settings › Permissions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要把便利貼貼在某個 Claude 對話上，Hintlet 需要請 Claude 開啟完整的輔助使用資訊，才能知道目前顯示的是哪個對話。\n\n開啟後 Claude 會多用一些記憶體與處理器資源。Hintlet 只讀取對話的網址與標題；只有你開了 AI 便利貼的 Chat 對話，才會讀取頁面上已載入的訊息來寫摘要。\n\n不開啟的話，在 Claude 上的便利貼會綁在整個視窗。之後可以在「設定 › 權限」改變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
