    "送出第一則訊息後，就能把便利貼貼在這個對話上。也可以先貼在整個 Claude 視窗。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send the first message, then you can stick a note on this conversation. Or stick it on the whole Claude window for now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "送出第一則訊息後，就能把便利貼貼在這個對話上。也可以先貼在整個 Claude 視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這一頁是瀏覽器自己的頁面，或讀不到網址，所以這張便利貼綁在視窗上，換到任何網頁都會看到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is one of the browser’s own pages, or its address couldn’t be read, so the note sticks to the window and shows on every page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一頁是瀏覽器自己的頁面，或讀不到網址，所以這張便利貼綁在視窗上，換到任何網頁都會看到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個備份來自較新版本的 Hintlet，請先更新 Hintlet 再匯入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This backup comes from a newer Hintlet. Update Hintlet, then import it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個備份來自較新版本的 Hintlet，請先更新 Hintlet 再匯入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個分頁還沒有網頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
