          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個檔案不是 Hintlet 的備份，或已損壞，沒有匯入任何東西。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file isn’t a Hintlet backup, or it’s damaged. Nothing was imported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個檔案不是 Hintlet 的備份，或已損壞，沒有匯入任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
