    },
    "開啟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn On"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後 Hintlet 會請 Claude 提供完整的輔助使用資訊，才能知道目前顯示的是哪個對話，讓便利貼貼在對話上。Claude 會多用一些記憶體與處理器資源。Hintlet 只讀取對話的網址與標題；只有開了 AI 便利貼的 Chat 對話，才會讀取頁面上已載入的訊息。關閉時，Claude 上的便利貼綁在整個視窗。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, Hintlet asks Claude for its full accessibility information, to know which conversation it shows so notes can stick to it. Claude then uses a little more memory and processor time. Hintlet reads only conversations’ addresses and titles; only in a Chat conversation with an AI note does it read the messages the page has loaded. When off, notes on Claude belong to the whole window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟後 Hintlet 會請 Claude 提供完整的輔助使用資訊，才能知道目前顯示的是哪個對話，讓便利貼貼在對話上。Claude 會多用一些記憶體與處理器資源。Hintlet 只讀取對話的網址與標題；只有開了 AI 便利貼的 Chat 對話，才會讀取頁面上已載入的訊息。關閉時，Claude 上的便利貼綁在整個視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "關掉設定、回到對話後再貼。": {
