          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use and Upload"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改用並上傳"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）會上傳到 Anthropic 的 Claude API，使用你的 API key 並由你付費。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an AI note writes its summary, its conversation (your requests and Claude’s replies) is uploaded to Anthropic’s Claude API, using your API key and billed to you. Automatic updates when you switch away from a conversation are uploaded too. Only conversations with an AI note are uploaded; other notes and conversations are not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）會上傳到 Anthropic 的 Claude API，使用你的 API key 並由你付費。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
