          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）會上傳到 OpenAI API，使用你的 OpenAI API key 並由你付費。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an AI note writes its summary, the content of its conversation (your requests and Claude’s replies) is uploaded to the OpenAI API, using your OpenAI API key at your expense. The automatic updates when you switch away from the conversation are uploaded too. Only conversations with an AI note are uploaded; other notes and conversations are not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）會上傳到 OpenAI API，使用你的 OpenAI API key 並由你付費。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，Hintlet 會在背景執行這台 Mac 上的 Claude Code，把它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）交給 Claude Code 上傳到 Anthropic，用你登入的 Claude 帳號的用量。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an AI note writes its summary, Hintlet runs Claude Code on this Mac in the background and hands it the content of the note’s conversation (your requests and Claude’s replies), which Claude Code uploads to Anthropic using the Claude account you signed in with. The automatic updates when you switch away from the conversation are uploaded too. Only conversations with an AI note are uploaded; other notes and conversations are not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，Hintlet 會在背景執行這台 Mac 上的 Claude Code，把它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）交給 Claude Code 上傳到 Anthropic，用你登入的 Claude 帳號的用量。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，Hintlet 會在背景執行這台 Mac 上的 Codex，把它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）交給 Codex 上傳到 OpenAI，用你登入 Codex 的 ChatGPT 帳號的用量。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When an AI note writes its summary, Hintlet runs Codex on this Mac in the background and hands it the content of the note’s conversation (your requests and Claude’s replies), which Codex uploads to OpenAI using the ChatGPT account you signed in to Codex with. The automatic updates when you switch away from the conversation are uploaded too. Only conversations with an AI note are uploaded; other notes and conversations are not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 便利貼要寫摘要時，Hintlet 會在背景執行這台 Mac 上的 Codex，把它所在對話的內容（你的要求與 Claude 的回覆）交給 Codex 上傳到 OpenAI，用你登入 Codex 的 ChatGPT 帳號的用量。之後切走對話時的自動更新也會上傳。只有 AI 便利貼的對話會上傳，其他便利貼與對話不會。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
