    "帳號要先在終端機登入：Claude Code 在 claude 裡輸入 /login，Codex 執行 codex login。Hintlet 只在背景執行它們寫摘要，不給它們任何工具，也不留下 session。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in from Terminal first: type /login in claude for Claude Code, run codex login for Codex. Hintlet only runs them in the background to write summaries, gives them no tools and leaves no session behind."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
