            "value": "Welcome to Hintlet"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歡迎使用 Hintlet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把便利貼貼在你正在做的事上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sticky notes that stick to what you're working on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把便利貼貼在你正在做的事上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跟著你的工作出現": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes that follow your work"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟著你的工作出現"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "貼在視窗、資料夾、網頁或 Claude、Codex 對話上。切走就收起來，回來時再出現。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick one on a window, folder, web page, or Claude or Codex conversation. It hides when you switch away and comes back when you return."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼在視窗、資料夾、網頁或 Claude、Codex 對話上。切走就收起來，回來時再出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在對話上，讓 AI 幫你記下目標、重點和下一步，切回來一眼就懂。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On a conversation, AI keeps its goal, key point and next step, so you're back up to speed at a glance."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在對話上，讓 AI 幫你記下目標、重點和下一步，切回來一眼就懂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不擋你的路": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Out of your way"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不擋你的路"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在便利貼底下打字時，它會淡開；按住 ⌥ 可以看穿全部便利貼。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes fade when you type under them. Hold ⌥ to see through them all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在便利貼底下打字時，它會淡開；按住 ⌥ 可以看穿全部便利貼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讓便利貼知道你在哪個視窗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let notes know which window you're in"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讓便利貼知道你在哪個視窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hintlet 需要「%@」權限，才能在你切換視窗時收起或拿出便利貼，並讓它跟著視窗移動。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet needs permission under %@ to hide and show notes as you switch windows, and to keep them with their window as it moves."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hintlet 需要「%@」權限，才能在你切換視窗時收起或拿出便利貼，並讓它跟著視窗移動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看位置和名稱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only places and names"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只看位置和名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讀的是前景視窗的位置、標題，以及網頁或對話的網址，不讀你寫的內容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It reads the front window's position and title, and the address of its page or conversation, not what you write."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀的是前景視窗的位置、標題，以及網頁或對話的網址，不讀你寫的內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不記錄打字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No keystroke logging"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不記錄打字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要「輸入監控」或「螢幕錄製」，也不會上傳任何東西。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It doesn't need Input Monitoring or Screen Recording, and uploads nothing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不需要「輸入監控」或「螢幕錄製」，也不會上傳任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
