        }
      }
    },
    "已經打開了卻沒有反應？那是給舊版的。在清單裡選 Hintlet，按「−」移除，再回來按「打開系統設定」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turned it on and nothing happened? The switch is for an older version. Select Hintlet in the list, remove it with −, then come back and click Open System Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已經打開了卻沒有反應？那是給舊版的。在清單裡選 Hintlet，按「−」移除，再回來按「打開系統設定」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打完字按 Esc。按住上方的標籤，可以換顏色或刪除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type, then press Esc. Press and hold the tag on top to change its colour or delete it."
